# Canonical identity for `git log`, `git shortlog` and anything that counts authors.
#
# Display only. A .mailmap says "these names are the same person" — it transfers no
# rights and is not evidence of ownership. The ownership record is the signed
# declaration (docs/OWNERSHIP.md in the CRYSTALLINE-FID repository).
#
# `Your Name <your.email@example.com>` is git's out-of-the-box default, left
# unconfigured on the machine these commits were authored on.
